  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>An ultra-plush, dual-ended cream blush brush for effortless application and blending.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Brush Formulation:</strong> All Formulas</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Brush Coverage:</strong> Buildable</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Bristle Type:</strong> Synthetic</p><p><br></p><p><strong>What Else You Need to Know:</strong> With its soft, ultra-plush bristles, this double-sided brush provides flawless application and effortless blending for your favorite cream blush.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Using the smaller angled end of your brush, lightly tap into your favorite cream blush and apply to the high points of your cheeks.<br>-Using the ultra-plush end of the brush, blend product into your cheeks for an effortless finish.</div></details>",
